  <p>Quick reference for a 70 kg swimmer:</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Duration</th><th scope="col">Moderate (7.0 MET)</th><th scope="col">Vigorous (10.0 MET)</th><th scope="col">Butterfly (13.0 MET)</th></tr></thead>
